 ts right on this Moon\, blurring the lines between what you own and what y
 ou long for\; be honest about illusions around value or self-worth. Mars\,
  the ruler of this Moon's sign\, sits quietly in your house of rest and en
 dings (natal house 12) but now transits your relationship zone (house 7) 
 — action here comes through others\, not solo effort. This closes a cycl
 e that began with the New Moon of April 17: revisit what you intended then
  about self-worth. What has actually shifted since? → Which intention ab
 out your own value deserves an honest\, clear-eyed review tonight?\n\n— 
